166","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":36,"impression_count":67338,"like_count":657,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":34,"retweet_count":46},"text":"台湾再次查扣越界中国渔船\n\n10月20日，台湾媒体报道，澎湖海巡队当日上午在七美西南方约25海里海域，发现一艘大陆籍渔船违法拖网作业并进入台湾限制水域。\n海巡艇多次广播要求停船未获配合，随即强靠登检，控制7名大陆籍船员，并发现船员正将渔获海抛销毁证据。 https://t.co/tK1ZMTm8z7 https://t.co/6SXyGRXxxF","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2112760790147359166"},{"author_id":"1206084655843180545","created_at":"2026-10-21T04:15:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112759688454697297"],"id":"2112759688454697297","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":26,"impression_count":10543,"like_count":66,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":6},"text":"世界各地的所有 neocloud, 只要资金成本高于 7%，基本上相对于 spacex 而言存在结构性的劣势，更不用说工程技术的效率差距了。随着 spacex 大举进入 neocloud 生意，大部分 neocloud 就是混吃等死了。\n\n财政结构永远决定长期胜负。 https://t.co/wOfzkHXvSc","url":"https://x.com/Svwang1/status/2112759688454697297"},{"author_id":"3178231","created_at":"2026-10-21T04:12:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112758776432304188"],"id":"2112758776432304188","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":76,"impression_count":23078,"like_count":106,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":44,"retweet_count":7},"text":"fin 的 AI 半导体终局推演系列都写到 4 了，这次讲的核心问题是：DeepSeek 这类谁都能下载的开源模型越来越便宜，OpenAI、Anthropic 会不会赚不到钱、没钱买 GPU？\n\nfin 认为不会。\n\n第一个理由：价格降，成本降得一样快。\n\n每代新芯片让同样的电多产出约一倍的 https://t.co/jSTiDLTrCF","url":"https://x.com/dotey/status/2112758776432304188"},{"author_id":"121908437","created_at":"2026-10-21T04:09:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112758169391009808"],"id":"2112758169391009808","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":19666,"like_count":142,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":55,"retweet_count":1},"text":"上周我们又咨询了省儿保的其他医生，这次医生的方案是只需做一次手术，于是就安排到了今天。\n\n刚刚十几分钟的小手术已经完成，娃受委屈了🥹 https://t.co/sfiK3uFXdV https://t.co/VbTYzr7wtB","url":"https://x.com/tualatrix/status/2112758169391009808"},{"author_id":"3178231","created_at":"2026-10-21T04:07:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_